        {
          "text": "’Ba dria alu alu anzi Israelini pi ma eselia ani’ba ovupi yi ma eselia ’diyi be, anyapa kani aria ’bani ecole nyale rari gbipi erini za ndariari, ma osu arini ra, ma ku nyaku drinia ci.",
          "type": "text",
